<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Gresik first half net sharply down.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Gresik first half net sharply down.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in billion rupiah except per share numbers)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 87.37	 vs    115.65</p>
<p>    Sales			     715.69	 vs    631.66</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    288.34	 vs    267.18</p>
<p>    Operating profit		150.28	 vs    151.84</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  117.91	 vs    137.23</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)    147.30	 vs    194.98</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     621.74	 vs    518.47</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Semen Gresik is one of Indonesia's largest cement makers.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
